### Test Pharmacy Medicines API with Date Filtering
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines

### Test 1: Get all medicines (no filters)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

### Test 2: Search by name only
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines?name=Omeprazole 40mg
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

### Test 3: Search by name and generic name
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines?name=Omeprazole 40mg&genericName=Omeprazole
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

### Test 4: Search with date range filtering
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines?name=Omeprazole 40mg&genericName=Omeprazole&fromDate=2023-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

### Test 5: Search with fromDate only
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines?name=Omeprazole 40mg&genericName=Omeprazole&fromDate=2023-01-01
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

### Test 6: Search with toDate only
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines?name=Omeprazole 40mg&genericName=Omeprazole&toDate=2024-12-31
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

### Test 7: Search with pagination and date filtering
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines?genericName=Omeprazole&fromDate=2023-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&page=1&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

### Test 8: Search by category with date filtering
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines?category=<category_id>&fromDate=2023-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

### Test 9: Search with status and date filtering
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines?genericName=Omeprazole&status=active&fromDate=2023-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>